  "intent": "A design sketch: trade Elemental access and totem utility against a fixed 51-point pool. Effects are proposals, not balance conclusions. Compare the custom investments with the reference snapshot.",
  "changes": {
    "shaman": {
      "earths-grasp": "Move control utility into the Elemental entry row. Enhancement builds must spend some of their shared budget outside their main tree to reach it.",
      "totemic-focus": "Limit this utility investment to three ranks of the reference progression. This reduces its maximum effect as well as its cost; freed points compete with other paths.",
      "improved-reincarnation": "Remove a situational recovery investment to make the alternative layout explicit. The removed option remains available in the reference ruleset.",
      "totemic-relay": "Prototype a healing/damage weaving incentive behind Elemental Focus and ten points above this row. Utility competes with deeper specialization within the same 51 points; combat effectiveness is untested."
    }
  },
